## HANDOUT 1.2.D: Practice with Linear Relationships

### 1. Sneakers Purchase
A shoe store sells each pair of sneakers for \$50, and there is a \$10 shipping fee per order.

**(a)** Complete the table:

| Number of Pairs Ordered | Total Cost (dollars) |
| :---: | :---: |
| 1 | |
| 2 | |
| 3 | |
| 4 | |
| 5 | |

**(b)** What is the independent variable and what is the dependent variable?  
**(c)** Write an equation that represents the relationship.  
**(d)** Is this linear relationship proportional? Explain your reasoning.

